<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal rejects bids to drain four-wk funds.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal rejects bids to drain four-wk funds.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said that it rejected all bids to drain four-week funds on Monday, while there was no demand for the draining of nine-week money.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
